---
description: Rules for the composition roots (provider-aware wiring)
globs: apps/api/src/main/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- `main/` is the only provider-aware layer: Render, Neon, Grafana Cloud/OTLP, R2. `local.ts` and `render.ts` compose the
  same app with different adapters/config. Nothing imports `main/`.
- Config comes from validated env (Zod); secrets only from the platform. Fail fast on missing config.
- Single instance, in-process worker (outbox relay, timers) — no Redis (ADR 006).
